flowchart TB
    A[Sense Signals] --> B[Severity]
    A --> C[Velocity]
    A --> D[Uncertainty]
    B --> E[Compute HVI]
    C --> E
    D --> E
    E --> F{Threshold}
    F -- HVI >= 8 --> G[Throttle]
    F -- HVI >= 12 --> H[Freeze Amplification]
    F -- HVI >= 16 --> I[Hard Stop]
    G --> J[Emit Receipt]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K[Review and Re-enable Criteria]
